# 🛒 Retail Shelf Stock & Out-of-Stock Tracking System (YOLO11)

Automated computer vision pipeline built with **YOLO11 Nano** and **Gradio** for retail shelf inventory auditing.

## 📁 Repository Contents
- `retail_shelf_tracking.ipynb`: End-to-end training, evaluation, and inference notebook.
- `best.pt`: Trained YOLO11 model weights.
- `results.png`: Model training metrics loss and mAP graphs.

## 📊 Key Metrics
- **Model Architecture**: YOLO11n (`imgsz=1280`)
- **Dataset**: Roboflow Retail Shelf V2 (`object`, `empty`)
- **Object mAP@50**: 86.3%
- **Inference Speed**: ~11.0 ms
